<title>USA: Pennsylvania Housing Agency $75 mln priced.</title>
<headline>Pennsylvania Housing Agency $75 mln priced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc said Tuesday it tentatively priced $75 million of Pennsylvania Housing Finance Agency single-family mortgage revenue bonds, Series 1996-53.</p>
<p>The issue contains $60 million of Series 1996-53A bonds subject to the AMT and $15 million Series 1996-53B federally taxable bonds.  </p>
